; Original private/artd.te uses domain_auto_trans for profman, dex2oat,
; derive_classpath and odrefresh; each belongs to artd_subprocess_type.
; Actual302/303 art_exec exec fails at the extra Linux inherited NNP1 gate.
; Keep NNP1 and all original transition/entrypoint/UID/capability checks.
; This admits only that original closed subprocess set through process2;
; it adds no process transition, executable, file, Binder, device or capability
; permission. In particular original artd execute_no_trans neverallow remains.
; Pin/set/source and positive/negative decisions must be reviewed on updates.
; Offline preparation is not compiler availability, authorization or APK proof.
(allow artd artd_subprocess_type (process2 (nnp_transition)))
